.git
.github
.venv
venv
# Docker matches patterns against the build-context root only (Go filepath.Match
# semantics: '*' does not cross '/'), so nested caches need an explicit '**/'
# prefix - a bare '__pycache__' would only exclude the root-level directory.
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.pytest_cache
**/.mypy_cache
**/.ruff_cache
runs
runs_*/
benchmarks/*.json
examples
docs
*.md
!README.md
